{'symbol': 'NKE', 'date': '2023-06-06 13:30:00', 'title': 'DICK\'S SPORTING GOODS PARTNERS WITH NIKE, JORDAN BRAND AND ATHLETES FOR NEXT PHASE OF "SPORTS CHANGE LIVES" CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'CARMELO ANTHONY, SABRINA IONESCU & MIKE TROUT AMONG NIKE AND JORDAN BRAND STARS FEATURED; EACH ATHLETE WILL NOMINATE A YOUTH SPORTS ORGANIZATION FOR A $75,000 "75FOR75" SPORTS MATTER GRANT; EXCLUSIVE, BEHIND-THE-SCENES CONTENT AVAILABLE TO CONNECTED DICK\'S SCORECARD AND NIKE MEMBERSHIP ACCOUNTS PITTSBURGH , JUNE 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, DICK\'S SPORTING GOODS (NYSE: DKS) REVEALED THE SECOND CREATIVE EXPRESSION OF THEIR "SPORTS CHANGE LIVES"\xa0CAMPAIGN – THIS TIME IN PARTNERSHIP WITH NIKE, (NYSE: NKE)\xa0– MARKING THE FIRST TIME THE TWO HAVE JOINED FORCES ON AN AD CAMPAIGN OF THIS CALIBER. \xa0FOLLOWING THE MARCH UNVEILING OF DICK\'S NEW BRAND PLATFORM, THIS SECOND PHASE\xa0CONSISTS OF PERSONAL STORIES FROM 10 NIKE AND JORDAN BRAND ATHLETES THAT SPOTLIGHT THE WAYS SPORTS HAVE CHANGED THEIR LIVES.'}